<p>Hello,</p>
<p>This is a reminder that your EsignCenter account, <strong><%= @current_account.name %></strong>, is <strong>permanently deleted on <%= @purge_date %></strong> — <%= @days_left %> days from now.</p>
<p>Everything goes: documents, templates, people and settings. It cannot be recovered afterwards.</p>
<p><strong>Download anything you want to keep</strong> from the <%= link_to 'templates page', @templates_url %> before then.</p>
<p><strong>Changed your mind?</strong> Any administrator can sign in and press "Cancel deletion" on the <%= link_to 'account settings page', @account_url %> before <%= @purge_date %>.</p>
<p>Questions? Write to <%= mail_to @support_email %>.</p>
<p>Thanks,<br>EsignCenter</p>
